
==============================================================================
MODULE 16 — CONFIG & PARAMETERSET
==============================================================================

  GIVEN  clean config, first freeze of the day
  WHEN   freeze_for_session()
  EXPECT v1 frozen, sl.pct=35
  ACTUAL v1:0f2df62a1fdb4e89, sl.pct=35   [OK]

  GIVEN  mid-day edit to sl.pct=999 attempted
  WHEN   freeze_for_session() (same day)
  EXPECT SAME version, edit ignored, sl.pct still 35
  ACTUAL v1:0f2df62a1fdb4e89, sl.pct=35   [OK]

  GIVEN  out-of-bounds candidate (sl.pct=500, max 100)
  WHEN   freeze_for_session()
  EXPECT REJECTED, OUT_OF_BOUNDS
  ACTUAL None ['OUT_OF_BOUNDS:risk.sl.pct=500 not in [1,100]']   [OK]


==============================================================================
MODULE 14 — LEDGER & PERSISTENCE
==============================================================================

  GIVEN  short 65 @ entry 11, mark decays to 9
  WHEN   compute_pnl()
  EXPECT unrealized = (11-9)*65 = 130.0
  ACTUAL unrealized=130.0   [OK]

  GIVEN  mark is missing/stale
  WHEN   compute_pnl()
  EXPECT unrealized=None, confidence=LOW_CONFIDENCE (never a fake zero)
  ACTUAL unrealized=None, confidence=LOW_CONFIDENCE   [OK]

  GIVEN  ledger short 65, broker reports short 130
  WHEN   reconcile()
  EXPECT MISSED_FILL, ledger untouched
  ACTUAL MISSED_FILL, ledger still -65   [OK]

  GIVEN  one leg still open at EOD
  WHEN   finalize_eod()
  EXPECT flat=False, alarm=NOT_FLAT_AT_EOD
  ACTUAL flat=False, alarm=NOT_FLAT_AT_EOD   [OK]


